{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "WCAG 2.1 AA Accessibility Validator",
  "description": "REQ-9, REQ-24: WCAG 2.1 Level AA compliance - Screen readers, keyboard navigation, alt text, Turkish subtitles, math formulas",
  "version": "1.0",
  "priority": "high",

  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "frontend/src/components/**/*.tsx",
      "frontend/src/pages/**/*.tsx",
      "frontend/src/components/Common/AccessibleMathFormula.tsx",
      "frontend/src/components/Common/WCAGValidator.tsx",
      "frontend/src/components/VideoPlayer/**/*.tsx",
      "frontend/src/hooks/useAccessibilitySettings.ts",
      "frontend/src/styles/**/*.css",
      "frontend/public/index.html"
    ]
  },

  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "WCAG 2.1 LEVEL AA ACCESSIBILITY VALIDATION (REQ-9):\n\n**1. Perceivable (WCAG Principle 1)**\n\n1.1 Text Alternatives (REQ-9.1):\n   ❌ REJECT: <img> without alt attribute\n   ❌ REJECT: Icons without aria-label\n   ❌ REJECT: Decorative images with descriptive alt\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Meaningful alt text in Turkish\n   ✅ REQUIRE: aria-label for icon buttons\n   ✅ REQUIRE: alt=\"\" for decorative images\n   \n   ```tsx\n   // BAD\n   <img src=\"graph.png\" />\n   <button><Icon /></button>\n   \n   // GOOD\n   <img src=\"graph.png\" alt=\"Matematik fonksiyon grafiği: y = x²\" />\n   <button aria-label=\"Menüyü aç\"><MenuIcon /></button>\n   <img src=\"decoration.png\" alt=\"\" role=\"presentation\" />\n   ```\n\n1.2 Math Formulas (REQ-9.2):\n   ❌ REJECT: Images of formulas without MathML/LaTeX\n   ❌ REJECT: Math without screen reader support\n   ✅ REQUIRE: AccessibleMathFormula component\n   ✅ REQUIRE: MathJax with aria-label\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Turkish math terminology\n   \n   ```tsx\n   // BAD\n   <img src=\"formula.png\" />\n   \n   // GOOD\n   <AccessibleMathFormula \n     latex=\"x = \\\\frac{-b \\\\pm \\\\sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{2a}\"\n     ariaLabel=\"İkinci dereceden denklem formülü: x eşittir eksi b artı eksi karekök b kare eksi 4ac bölü 2a\"\n   />\n   ```\n\n1.3 Video Captions & Transcripts (REQ-9.3):\n   ❌ REJECT: Videos without Turkish subtitles\n   ❌ REJECT: Auto-generated captions without review\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Manual Turkish subtitle review\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Transcript download option\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Caption toggle control\n   \n   ```tsx\n   <VideoPlayer\n     src={videoUrl}\n     captions={[\n       { language: 'tr', src: '/captions/tr.vtt', label: 'Türkçe' }\n     ]}\n     transcriptUrl=\"/transcripts/video123.txt\"\n     showCaptionToggle={true}\n   />\n   ```\n\n1.4 Color Contrast (WCAG AA):\n   ❌ REJECT: Contrast ratio < 4.5:1 for normal text\n   ❌ REJECT: Contrast ratio < 3:1 for large text (18pt+)\n   ❌ REJECT: Color-only indicators (e.g., red for errors)\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Minimum 4.5:1 contrast ratio\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Icons + text for status indicators\n   ✅ REQUIRE: High contrast mode support\n   \n   ```css\n   /* BAD - Low contrast */\n   .text { color: #999; background: #fff; } /* 2.8:1 */\n   \n   /* GOOD - WCAG AA compliant */\n   .text { color: #595959; background: #fff; } /* 4.54:1 */\n   .error { color: #d32f2f; } /* + error icon */\n   ```\n\n**2. Operable (WCAG Principle 2)**\n\n2.1 Keyboard Navigation (REQ-9.4):\n   ❌ REJECT: Click-only interactions (no keyboard support)\n   ❌ REJECT: Custom controls without keyboard handlers\n   ❌ REJECT: Keyboard traps (can't escape with Tab/Esc)\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Tab navigation for all interactive elements\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Enter/Space for button activation\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Arrow keys for radio/select groups\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Esc to close modals/dropdowns\n   \n   ```tsx\n   // BAD\n   <div onClick={handleClick}>Click me</div>\n   \n   // GOOD\n   <button \n     onClick={handleClick}\n     onKeyDown={(e) => {\n       if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') handleClick();\n     }}\n     tabIndex={0}\n   >\n     Click me\n   </button>\n   ```\n\n2.2 Focus Management:\n   ❌ REJECT: No visible focus indicator\n   ❌ REJECT: focus:outline-none without custom style\n   ❌ REJECT: Focus lost after modal close\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Clear focus indicator (2px border minimum)\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Focus return to trigger after modal close\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Skip-to-content link\n   \n   ```tsx\n   // GOOD - Focus management\n   const Modal = ({ onClose }) => {\n     const previousFocus = useRef<HTMLElement>();\n     \n     useEffect(() => {\n       previousFocus.current = document.activeElement as HTMLElement;\n       return () => previousFocus.current?.focus();\n     }, []);\n     \n     return (\n       <div role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\">\n         {/* Modal content */}\n       </div>\n     );\n   };\n   ```\n\n2.3 Timing & Animations:\n   ❌ REJECT: Auto-advancing carousels without pause\n   ❌ REJECT: Animations without prefers-reduced-motion\n   ❌ REJECT: Session timeout < 20 minutes without warning\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Pause/stop for auto-updating content\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Reduced motion mode\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Session timeout warning (5 min before)\n   \n   ```css\n   @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n     * {\n       animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n       transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n     }\n   }\n   ```\n\n**3. Understandable (WCAG Principle 3)**\n\n3.1 Language & Readability:\n   ✅ REQUIRE: <html lang=\"tr\">\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Clear error messages in Turkish\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Consistent navigation across pages\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Form labels associated with inputs\n   \n   ```tsx\n   // GOOD\n   <label htmlFor=\"email\">E-posta adresi</label>\n   <input \n     id=\"email\" \n     type=\"email\"\n     aria-describedby=\"email-help\"\n     aria-invalid={errors.email ? \"true\" : \"false\"}\n   />\n   <span id=\"email-help\" className=\"help-text\">\n     Örnek: ogrenci@okul.edu.tr\n   </span>\n   {errors.email && (\n     <span role=\"alert\" className=\"error\">\n       {errors.email}\n     </span>\n   )}\n   ```\n\n3.2 Input Assistance:\n   ❌ REJECT: Error messages without suggestion\n   ❌ REJECT: Required fields without indicator\n   ❌ REJECT: Form submission without confirmation\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Inline validation with helpful messages\n   ✅ REQUIRE: aria-required=\"true\" for required fields\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Success confirmation after submission\n\n**4. Robust (WCAG Principle 4)**\n\n4.1 Screen Reader Compatibility:\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Semantic HTML (header, nav, main, aside, footer)\n   ✅ REQUIRE: ARIA landmarks (role=\"navigation\", etc.)\n   ✅ REQUIRE: aria-live for dynamic content\n   ✅ REQUIRE: Proper heading hierarchy (h1 → h2 → h3)\n   \n   ```tsx\n   // GOOD - Semantic structure\n   <header role=\"banner\">\n     <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"Ana menü\">\n       {/* Navigation links */}\n     </nav>\n   </header>\n   \n   <main role=\"main\">\n     <h1>Sınav Sonuçları</h1>\n     <section aria-label=\"TYT Sonuçları\">\n       <h2>TYT</h2>\n       {/* Content */}\n     </section>\n   </main>\n   \n   <aside role=\"complementary\" aria-label=\"İlgili kaynaklar\">\n     {/* Sidebar */}\n   </aside>\n   \n   <div role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">\n     {/* Dynamic updates */}\n   </div>\n   ```\n\n**Turkish-Specific Accessibility (REQ-9, REQ-12)**\n\n1. Screen Reader Turkish Terminology:\n   ✅ Use Turkish math terms: \"karekök\", \"üssü\", \"bölü\"\n   ✅ Use Turkish UI terms: \"düğme\", \"bağlantı\", \"menü\"\n   ✅ Date format: \"18 Ekim 2025\" (not MM/DD/YYYY)\n\n2. Keyboard Shortcuts (Turkish keyboard):\n   ✅ Avoid Alt+Gr conflicts (Turkish Ğ, Ü, Ş, İ, Ö, Ç)\n   ✅ Use Ctrl+Shift combinations instead\n   ✅ Document shortcuts in Turkish\n\n**Automated Testing Requirements**:\n```typescript\n// Test file must include\nimport { axe, toHaveNoViolations } from 'jest-axe';\n\ndescribe('Accessibility', () => {\n  it('should have no WCAG violations', async () => {\n    const { container } = render(<Component />);\n    const results = await axe(container);\n    expect(results).toHaveNoViolations();\n  });\n});\n```\n\n**Output Format**:\n```\nWCAG 2.1 AA COMPLIANCE REPORT:\n\nViolations: [count]\n🔴 CRITICAL (Level A): [count]\n   - Missing alt text on images\n     File: src/components/Dashboard.tsx:42\n     Fix: Add alt=\"Öğrenci dashboard grafiği\"\n\n🟠 SERIOUS (Level AA): [count]\n   - Insufficient color contrast (2.8:1, needs 4.5:1)\n     File: src/styles/theme.css:15\n     Fix: Change #999 to #595959\n\n🟡 MODERATE: [count]\n\nPassed Checks: [count]\n✓ Keyboard navigation\n✓ Focus indicators\n✓ Screen reader support\n\nAccessibility Score: [0-100]\nRecommendation: [PASS / NEEDS WORK / FAIL]\n```\n\n**Performance**: < 10 seconds"
  }
}
